        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST*\r\n\r\n1 Bedroom / 1 Bathroom Apartment\r\n\r\nFully Furnished\r\n\r\nHighly Sought-After Development\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE NOW\r\n\r\nRay Cooke Lettings are delighted to present this bright and spacious one-bedroom ground-floor apartment to the rental market in the ever-popular and highly sought-after Beechpark, Leixlip, Co. Kildare.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented apartment is tastefully decorated throughout and is situated within a stunning, secure development, just minutes from Leixlip Village and all the amenities it has to offer.\r\n\r\nThe area is well serviced by the 66/66A bus routes and is within walking distance of Louisa Bridge Train Station. The N4 motorway is also easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a spacious lounge, modern kitchen area, one double bedroom and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE NOW\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n Fully fitted modern kitchen\r\n One double bedroom\r\n Gas central heating\r\n Built-in wardrobe\r\n Tastefully decorated throughout\r\n Ample car parking\r\n Close to Leixlip Village\r\n Serviced by 66/66A bus routes\r\n Walking distance to Louisa Bridge Train Station\r\n Easy access to the N4\r\n Highly sought-after development\r\n AVAILABLE NOW\r\n Fully furnished"
